        "id": 139270,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-11T12:55:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My ex-boyfriend I met through gaming - during high school, a few of us had started getting together to play board games (this was my first foray into good board games, though I'd been interested for a long time), and my friend whose house we were meeting at had a brother who joined us once and quickly became a regular fixture. My current girlfriend I met through other (equally cool) ways, but her board game collection is almost as large as mine, so no trouble there :D</p>",
