        "id": 139274,
        "name": "cmschex",
        "username": "cmschex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-11T23:01:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm very fortunate that my wife embraced my passion for board games when I started getting into them a few years ago. &nbsp;In fact, almost every game I own has to play at least solidly two player because I still do most of my plays with her. &nbsp;In addittion to SotM (which we recently got my 8 yr old daughter hooked on), she really loves worker placement/euros - Keyflower, Viticulture and Castles of Burgundy are her favorites</p>",
