        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/{size}/2168_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-13T12:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my house, all the gaming is done by me! &nbsp;My wife isn't a gamer at all. She's one of those folks who just doesn't see the appeal and finds everything I play utterly confusing. The only thing she likes is Ticket To Ride, so if we play, we at that &nbsp;</p><p>Altough, I did convince her and my parents to play the Munchkin I got at Xmas... That was a total train wreck!&nbsp;</p><p><span>My gaming is done with friends, while my wife joins in with other interest we have. It wouldn't do for everyone to enjoy the same things!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
